{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">IF...THEN...ELSE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309811","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/IF...THEN...ELSE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/IF...THEN...ELSE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"IF...THEN...ELSE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">IF...THEN...ELSE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Evaluates and returns one of two expressions, depending\non the value of a specified condition.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IF...THEN...ELSE-function__syntax_GC18PJ2694250\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d494195e105\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"IF...THEN...ELSE-function__idGDL2JC2671403\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>IF <var class=\"keyword varname\">condition</var> THEN <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression1</var> ELSE <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression2</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">condition</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression whose value is logical (TRUE or FALSE).</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression1</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A constant, field name, variable name, or expression. If the <var class=\"keyword varname\">condition</var> is\nTRUE, then the function returns this value.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression2</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A constant, field name, variable name, or expression whose value\nis of a data type that is compatible with the data type of <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression1</var>.\nIf the <var class=\"keyword varname\">condition</var> is FALSE or the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>),\nthen the function returns this value.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IF...THEN...ELSE-function__example_GC18PK2694264\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d494195e190\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">You\ncan use the IF . . . THEN . . . ELSE function when you want to sort records\nin an unusual order. In this example, the Customers are sorted so\nthat those with a Balance greater than $10,000 appear first, then\nthose with Balances between $1,000 and $10,000, and finally those\nwith Balance of $1,000 or less:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-ifelsf.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"IF...THEN...ELSE-function__idGDL2JD2671411\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FOR EACH Customer NO-LOCK BY <strong class=\"ph b\">IF Customer.Balance &gt; 10000 THEN 1</strong>\n<strong class=\"ph b\">  ELSE (IF Customer.Balance &gt; 1000 THEN 2 ELSE 3)</strong> BY Customer.SalesRep:\n  DISPLAY Customer.SalesRep Customer.Balance Customer.Name.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"HIDE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/HIDE-statement.html\">HIDE statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IF...THEN...ELSE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IF...THEN...ELSE-statement.html\">IF...THEN...ELSE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309811","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"IF...THEN...ELSE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IF...THEN...ELSE-function.html","type":"Manual"}